                    },
                    "message": "Same question on the Compatible here.  @paligill@gmail.com"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/harma_mb.json",
                    "line": 755,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "If the firmware image is same for all the devices then it can use the same CompatibleHardware label otherwise not. Already replied on the other thread too. Would let @Kevin.Tung@quantatw.com to confirm if the same image goes on all three VRs."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/harma_mb.json",
                    "line": 755,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "11110128-KevinTung",
                        "email": "kevin.wtmh@gmail.com",
                        "username": "kevintungquanta"
                    },
                    "message": "The firmware image is not the same for all three VRs."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/harma_mb.json",
                    "line": 755,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@Kevin.Tung@quantatw.com The purpose of CompatibleHardware is to make sure we don't burn a wrong image on a target device. So, lets add a suffix to ISL69269 to define its exact purpose and the VR its intended for."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/harma_mb.json",
                    "line": 755,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "11110128-KevinTung",
                        "email": "kevin.wtmh@gmail.com",
                        "username": "kevintungquanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Added device-specific suffixes to ISL69269 VRs in the PDI: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/80854"
                }
            ],
